{"id":"bvzh5pi3hwkvj0uwjqfn5tqma","title":"美国数据中心年耗电82太瓦时小时，碳排放量等同丹麦","originalTitle":"US data centers now burn more electricity than a midsized country","summary":"美国哈佛大学研究团队通过卫星图像分析403个数据中心，发现其年耗电82太瓦时小时（占全美1.8%），碳排放量25.7百万公吨（等同丹麦），其中54%电力来自化石燃料。MIT系统动力学专家John Sterman指出，若不改变能源结构，此类影响将形成长期碳锁定，建议政策要求数据中心接入清洁能源电网。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"The Verge · AI"},"links":{"original":"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1034668/data-centers-electricity-climate-pollution-study-harvard"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-16T20:27:58.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-16T21:03:36.060Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-16T21:03:36.060Z","category":"industry","tags":["行业动态","政策/监管"],"score":61,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"Justine Calma","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"industry","name":"行业动态"},{"slug":"policy","name":"政策监管"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}